{"id":"d5ffc25900e8348f","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-omega-ce-set.md","title":"omega-c.e. 集","display":"df-omega-ce-set — omega-c.e. 集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-omega-ce-set","aliases":["43-df-omega-ce-set"],"display":"df-omega-ce-set — omega-c.e. 集","depends_on":["[[43-df-omegace]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: bounded-change form of omega-c.e.; Denjoy, Demuth, and Density §2.2; https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf","verification_status":"definition-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-omega-ce-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-omega-ce-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-ce-set — omega-c.e. 集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1c8300f7d21b067\" href=\"?note=a1c8300f7d21b067\" title=\"43-df-omegace\">43-df-omegace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: bounded-change form of omega-c.e.; Denjoy, Demuth, and Density §2.2; <a href=\"https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为特征函数；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1c8300f7d21b067\" href=\"?note=a1c8300f7d21b067\" title=\"43-df-omegace\">43-df-omegace</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(\\chi_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(\\chi_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留与函数版一致的有界变化定义，避免把集合 omega-c.e. 与跳跃超低条件混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omegace","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8300f7d21b067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omegace]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omegace","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8300f7d21b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 为特征函数；见 [[43-df-omegace]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\iff\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(\\chi_A).","display":true}],"bytes":939,"backlinks":[{"id":"9728b42de85725ba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\omega\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-omega-ce-set]]。下式定义自然数集合上的谓词 $\\operatorname{BoundedChangeSet}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-507","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-ce-set]] — omega-c.e. 集"}],"outgoing":["a1c8300f7d21b067"]}